% A module in filc mode only because it has a local object, which it
% never reads (docs/gallina-backend.md, M4), for
% rocq/backend/tests/pizlonate.sh: it has no pointer class, and the
% load from a constant address still gets its check.
func(f, export, w, [], [
    block(start, [], [
        local_alloc(x, 8),
        let(tmp(v), w, load(sw), [const(16)])
    ], ret(tmp(v)))
]).
